om/v/t64.5771-25/499619808_1182381367083581_8403279582652785227_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JEjrHoDb3qgQ7kNvwGbF2N-&_nc_oc=Adlf4p4fxLpfvicHhtbn-dvOa_5jmG5W7rkwUw-BYNUPSLyKuH2glE59Jy-Cp3hb0x8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfscD9hnmKQ61D72jqA3a2thaI1WwqKAdYvTyBlMjGZiog&oe=6999B96D"}, {"file_name": "StoryMode.png", "id": "32811313745133632", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618297_32811313751800298_6861778986600558374_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aHuUxq0PnnAQ7kNvwHQjcv0&_nc_oc=AdnhkDGRPwsJ7vydKBINjIALC5aBxyJ2BYIZzlDQIwuW5ovc6WxX3DROvSgD639ny5Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftKSpM-ZNcrjz0jSL0GK2-csmCm0nWWAc0yaySBekt3Lg&oe=6999B9B7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "GameThumbnail.png", "id": "864108156302774", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619685_864108159636107_8140054702670079169_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sOusEbkUXWIQ7kNvwF8lChj&_nc_oc=Adk4JUzdIdkGzd1-Ni-roQeUj-fAhjAwTvXTvazdxmILSHKX_wi6zrptnB11Uu4wll4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs6YBgDYkbK1DnzhTdWlMWWL4Zwo4LhX2bD1d8j2E_iGQ&oe=699991AC"}, "display_name": "Novalight", "keywords": ["Story", "Gamemodes", "Space", "Robots", "Adventure"], "long_description": "# Welcome to Novalight!\n\nNovalight is a free-to-play, hand-based movement multiplayer game that takes place thousands of years into the future where humans have gone extinct after a failed experiment caused the earth to explode.\n\n{2872839186238379}\n\n# Choose Your Own Path:\n\nJoin up to **20 players** in a public server or create a private one with friends!\n\nPlay through either the **Story Mode, Gamemodes** or perhaps just hangout & chat with friends in the lobby.\n\n{2244974466007548}\n\n# Customization:\n\nYou can customize your character with a wide variety of cosmetics!\n\nand may purchase them with **Nebulite** in the store!\nth